aising ceiling from Rs 400 crore to Rs 450 crore; both go to an EGM on 17 September _(~5.1% of mcap)_."],"order_wins":["**Ceigall India** — a **Rs 274.08 crore bid-cost letter of acceptance** from the Ministry of Road Transport & Highways for the **Bile–Migging package of NH-913**, the Frontier Highway in Arunachal Pradesh, on EPC terms over 48 months with five years of maintenance. The award is to a joint venture with Rajinder Infrastructure in which Ceigall holds 70% _(~5.1% of mcap)_.","**Oriana Power** — a **Rs 214.80 crore EPC contract, inclusive of GST**, for 50 MW of solar capacity in Rajasthan from a cement producer the filing does not name, to be executed in nine months with ten years of operation and maintenance _(~8.7% of mcap)_.","**L&T Technology Services** — reports a **landmark engagement valued at over US$ 75 million** from a leading global technology enterprise. Neither of its filings today is in cache and the announcement states no rupee equivalent, so the figure is carried in dollars as filed.","**Virtual Galaxy Infotech** — a purchase order of **about Rs 5.45 crore, excluding taxes**, from Mizoram Cooperative Apex Bank to upgrade its core banking system across the head office and 36 branches on a five-year service model.","**Dynamic Services & Security** — a **Rs 4.18 crore facility-management order** from the West Bengal Medical Services Corporation covering two mental hospitals, running October 2026 to March 2027 _(~1.2% of mcap)_.","**A B Cotspin India** — a press release reporting a cotton-yarn order of **approximately Rs 10.17 crore**."],"other_notable":["**Kairosoft AI Solutions** — approves a **stock split**, one Rs 10 share into ten of Re 1 each, and the consequent alteration of capital.","**CEAT** — discloses **actions taken or orders passed** against the company."]},"unlocks":[{"company":"Kahan Packaging Ltd","date":"2026-08-19","days":0,"detail":"BUY BY 19-08-2026 · record date 20-08-2026 · 3:1 bonus","ex_date":"2026-08-20","mcap":20.2